    "text": "← Back to the wire\nSports\nWhich ex-high school standouts from City of Reno area will play on Saturday, Oct. 24?\nOn Saturday, Oct. 24, this former City of Reno area high school standout will be in action.\nThursday, Oct 22\nBy L. K. Jett\nThis former City of Reno area high school athlete set to compete on Saturday, Oct. 24.\nDrew Dutton\nIndiana Wesleyan Wildcats\nWide receiver\nJunior\n6′2″ 190\nReno High School\nHometown: Reno\nNext Game: vs. Madonna Crusaders, Saturday, Oct. 24, 4 p.m.",
